    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoahiimnaan eenda beega mideawa eaweega, nea eesh ea ghameang'meang', nea ghwadalaalaana hoorgeeda ASEETA ea dea Dayeenda Gisilleanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea bugusta naweadinga mujiini, earada, meatkwajeega sean bea eenda, abeeda gwanda geeta eaweega, mideawa haghweega heeluut damaniyeenya, nea inyeessa gooruudu haghweagaaschi gilasheah; nea seengeaba geedi gaba giiheapta eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maygudugwanda gilinyoo ea mooshteayda gil, nea hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda bea ASEETA ea dea Dayeenda Gisilleanda gaygwanda jeadaanyi, nea soomjoagaaschi gayghoaghadoawan niny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwadaah gheamamdaanyi, nea gheawungaaschi gaygwanda gheamamuunatka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maygudugwanda eaweeda; nea magasa weeshinda gheaboong'nyeanda ghana aseeta aba gideaba Ng'utamiida was ASEETA gayghoah weeshinda nyaawa, saawa gaygoombaliischi ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hinooda Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean, “Ng'asheesu ghwadoabiiw ak ea huumwa gil. Nea Ng'utamiida, was ASEETA bea gurooruunatka sibanga, abeeda gaygoojeagu malaykajeandaanyi goohiimsa soomjoagaaschi ng'asheega jea gabean ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, gaydahidu nea ghaalamwajaanyi. Ghang'wana siida ang'waay ng'asheega siramoorani aba jeedeaba gitaaboani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini Yohana ghaayiinyi nea ghaadaayi ng'asheesu. Damandida aayiinyi nea ghaadaayiin, hean geabeedeaysi ng'eanyi ak ghaghadoawanyi aba madeeda malaykajeanda ahiimnaan ng'asheesuun; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwayeeshiinean, “Adiidu gisini gidida! Aniini geawooschi soomjeanda sea ang'iing'i sea fuga siduupcheewi was sibanga, ea fugiga ang'waay ng'asheegeaba gitaaboaniin. Aghadoawana ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshean, “Adiiroori ng'asheega siramoorani bea gitaaboaniin, aba gideaba damanda nineekiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida sina ng'asheega munyas daraanya sinooda ng'asheega munyas, dea mideawa ririnnyeanda daraanya ririnnyeanda, dea doabiiwaat daraanya doobiiwnata, dea ghaydit ea daraanya ghaydidanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, ghaawunyi nea ghaalamwajaanyi, nea geayeadu gichea daadaw siida, ak ghaadawji giliwas sih giduurji gidaghayi sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geawooschi Alfa ea Omega, dea madeeda gil ea dea huuydean, was dea giing'eeta ea dea huuydean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana fuga ahuun hang'weaka nyaawa, ak gwandeawa doobiiwnata jea gaweesiina geeta eaweega ak gaweay jeeda mujiini aba gidaghuudajeagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoowa bea jaroodean gwanda gudajeega ea beeneediga ea fuga hiseada ea fuga nuusa buuneeda ea fuga ghadoawani sanaamu, ea gilinyoo ghabwariiy ng'uyyeega nea gwasin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aniini Yesu, neajeagu malaykajeandeanyu headaang'u nea gweadu muwuunooni heeda ganiisajeega. Aniini geawooschi hawunyeanda ea jeata Dawdi, was miing'weandida aboong'u bea muchuunoodean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Guroorooda ea Sibeeda, “Beeni.” Nea siida iing'shi dayi “Beeni.” Ak doani siida bearji muwooshta, nea dea gasa ea dageanda beega eaweega nea manda sheayeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geereekusi giliwas sih iiy ramoorangeaba gitaaboani: giliwas sih iyahaat, gaygooheasa ASEETA sawanaduutsu sirugu aba jeedeaba gitaaboani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak giliwas sih iigeanda gili aba jeeda ng'asheega siramoar bea gitaaboaniin, gaygageanda ASEETA headaanyi aba jeeda geetida bea eaweegean ea aba jeeda mujiineedida ghaydidiin, sirugu ng'asheagaaschi aba jeedeaba gitaaboani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida muuwu ng'asheesu gwayi, “Asi aba huumwa ghaawunyi nea ghaalamwajaanyi.” Amin. Beeni, Ng'utamiida was Yesu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiida was Yesu agoogeeni sean oowooschi ghaydidiin. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
